{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"60702e0710d5f1d34bb2b0df0b82eb51faf05fd9622bc4b0a3d60ac12afb53a8","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP authentication composite verifier","key_entities":["src/rebar/_mcp_auth.py","src/rebar/_config_schema.py","src/rebar/mcp_server.py","scripts/check_server_manifest.py","auth_proxy_secret_env","auth_proxy_secret_header","auth_proxy_identity_header","auth_proxy_scopes","x-proxy-auth","x-forwarded-user","X-Forwarded-*","McpConfig","TokenVerifier","AccessToken","mcp.auth_strategies"],"problem_keywords":["authentication","trusted proxy","header spoofing","oauth2-proxy","identity verification","shared secret","forwarded headers"],"propositions":["A trusted-proxy verifier must validate an inbound shared-secret header using constant-time comparison and extract identity only if the secret is valid.","All X-Forwarded-* headers and configured identity/secret headers must be stripped from requests that do not present a valid shared secret, with normalization of header-case and underscore/dash variants to prevent smuggling.","The proxy verifier must mint an AccessToken with client_id=identity, scopes=auth_proxy_scopes, and resource=auth_resource_server_url, allowing it to pass the composite audience check.","The proxy verifier must refuse startup if the environment variable named by auth_proxy_secret_env is absent or empty.","When auth_proxy_scopes is unset or empty, a proxy-authenticated principal holds no scopes and is denied 403 by any non-empty auth_required_scopes."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785821630277902010,"uuid":"62e53576-61d4-438c-a7f1-89abd81fb79b"}